Body:

Our osmanthus oolong cold brew is here. Steeped slowly in cold water, so the floral and tea notes both come through fresh, with no sugar added. 20 yuan a cup, we open at 11 every day. Whether reservations will be needed isn't decided yet — as soon as it is, I'll say so right away.", "sourceIds": ["doc_a6482c1c-6f17-4594-b452-ee961acf3409"]}

